{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:48f390b76e41547f","name":"Outlaw Tech Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-48f390b76e41547f","title":"Outlaw Tech Talent Tree","revision":25355,"timestamp":"2024-11-16T22:34:34Z","sha256":"ec64578fff94cdd0bcd565798bec8d0c20d19e017b4441ce0c668c2e4de7e516","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=25355","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Outlaw%20Tech%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-48f390b76e41547f","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrels"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrels"}," learn a variety of tricks that allow them to squeeze more life out of ailing technology, and they can enhance their gear in ways the manufacturer never intended.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Fast Repairs"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jury-Rig"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jury-Rig"}," an object or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," gains a number of temporary ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," equal to the result of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check. Damage is subtracted from these temporary ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," first, and temporary ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," go away at the conclusion of the encounter.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Hot Wire"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can use your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check modifier instead of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check modifier when making ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," checks to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Improve Access"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improve_Access"},". You are considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," skill for the purposes of using this Talent. If you are entitled to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check reroll, you may reroll your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check instead (subject to the same circumstances and limitations).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Jedi Counseling"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Counseling"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Counseling"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Q:"]}," If my ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrel","referenceId":"reference:316d580fd4c35ecc"}," takes both ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Trace"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trace"}]}," and ",{"tag":"b","children":["Hot Wire"]},", can they make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check in place of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gather Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gather_Information","referenceId":"reference:a719fb58321fb08c"}," as long as they have access to a computer terminal that they can hot-wire?\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["A:"]}," No. ",{"tag":"b","children":["Hot Wire"]}," works only when ",{"tag":"a","children":["Improving Access"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improving_Access"}," to a computer (that is, when you're trying to improve the computer's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attitude"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," toward you). Making ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," checks in place of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gather Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gather_Information","referenceId":"reference:a719fb58321fb08c"}," checks is a completely separate use of the Skill, so ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," can't be substituted in that case.\n"]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Quick Fix"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, you may ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jury-Rig"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jury-Rig"}," an object or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," that is not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disabled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disabled"},". All normal benefits and penalties for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jury-Rigging"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jury-Rigging"}," still apply.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Personalized Modifications"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you may tweak the settings, grips, and moving parts of a powered weapon you wield, tailoring it to your needs. For the remainder of a the encounter, you gain a +1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus on attack rolls, and a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus on damage rolls with that weapon. You can use this Talent only on powered weapons (those that require an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cell"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cell","referenceId":"reference:a3dedb9c17e4ee9d"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Power Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Power_Pack","referenceId":"reference:2b783ab0537ca5d0"}," to operate), including weapons connected to a larger power source (such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Systems"},").\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["The Outlaw Tech Talent Tree"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Outlaw Tech Talent Tree fills some niches left by the existing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," rules and options for repairing broken pieces of technology. Here's a behind-the-screen look at the design decisions that went into creating these ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Fast Repairs"]}," is designed to make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jury-Rigging"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jury-Rigging"}," more appealing to tech-oriented characters. As it stands now, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jury-Rigging"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jury-Rigging"}," an object or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," moves it up the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," but does not provide temporary ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},". If your ship is at 0 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," and you jury-rig it, it's still ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disabled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disabled"}," from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Point"}," loss. This new ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," alleviates that problem, while still making ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jury-Rigging"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jury-Rigging"}," useful for ships pushed down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," by other means (such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion"}," damage)."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Quick Fix"]}," builds on ",{"tag":"b","children":["Fast Repairs"]}," and gives a techie character a way to restore some ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," that's still in the fight, but brings with it the threat of becoming ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disabled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disabled"}," at the end of the encounter. This new ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," also gives ship ",{"tag":"a","children":["Engineers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Engineers"}," something else to do in combat, especially in desperate situations, and it can bring a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," back up to full fighting form very quickly."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Hot Wire"]}," is similar to the other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"},"-substitution ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," and makes sense for a techie who may not be the best slicer around."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Personalized Modifications"]}," is designed to give a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrel","referenceId":"reference:316d580fd4c35ecc"}," another means of activating some of their other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"},". For example, many of the Scoundrel's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Misfortune Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Misfortune_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:572da85689e76d52"}," rely on a successful attack roll to activate. Combined with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tech Specialist"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tech_Specialist","referenceId":"reference:62e86e4173a4731b"}," Feat, this new ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," gets the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrel","referenceId":"reference:316d580fd4c35ecc"}," a small boost to attacks that can compensate for the difference between low ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," progression and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defense"}," progression, even at high levels. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrel","referenceId":"reference:316d580fd4c35ecc"}," might still need to work closely with their friends against tougher foes, but this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," is designed to capture the feel of tweaking your own weapon while still synergizing with many of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Misfortune Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Misfortune_Talents"},"."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
